  | tier | colour | underline | glyph |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | ordinary citation | indigo | solid | none |
  | forward reference | sky | dashed | ↗ |
  | **not proved here** | **fuchsia** | **dotted** | **‡** |

  Fuchsia is used nowhere else, and the bottom tier OUTRANKS the middle one.

